flowchart LR
    S[Hashed source and runtime snapshot] --> H[Declared host GCC]
    H --> A[Fresh stage 1 Cinder]
    S --> A
    A --> O2[Original stage 2 objects]
    O2 --> L2[System linker and declared startup libraries]
    L2 --> B[Stage 2 Cinder and IR tool]
    S --> B
    B --> O3[Original stage 3 objects]
    O3 --> L3[Same linker configuration]
    L3 --> C[Stage 3 Cinder and IR tool]
    O2 --> D[Exact object and executable hashes]
    O3 --> D
    B --> T[Separate authored suites and 1000 native programs]
    C --> T
    D --> E[Raw source-bound bootstrap manifest]
    T --> E
